    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia dhaw kodi Pasur jacway ri Were i wi migam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jacway ri Were i wi migam Pasur wod pa Imer, m'oyido obedo jadwoŋ ma Ot pa Rwoth, owinjo Yeremia tito gigipiny me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owodho cik ni wogoyan t'ikethan i lijegere cegin kodi waŋkac pa Benyamin ma yumalo i Ot pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odikin ma luwo, munyo Pasur otieko gonyo Yeremia i lijegere, Yeremia owaco rigo nike Rwoth k'ocwoko nyingin ni Pasur to ni Lworo madwoŋ i thenge je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Rwoth waco ama: Alokin lworo madwoŋ ri in won kodi ri merin perin je; aka jolatho g'abor pa jokwor pajo k'ineno. Aka alamiyo Yuda gibe i cingi kere ma Babilon; jolatiŋo jo paka jotwec tero Jobabilon, aka jolaneko jo g'abor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamiyo thoŋino je ma tindi madwoŋ me, magowa mere je, gima iye je ma bey, cwe pa kerin je ma Yuda i cingi jokwor pajo, ma jobino kinyaga jo, jolakwanyo jo to jotero i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka in, Pasur, kodi jopeco perin je, ilamako win t'itero win i twec i Babilon. Wilatho t'iyiko win koro, win kodi merin mewin je, m'itieko tuco rijo wac Were ma twodo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia geŋisa ri Rwoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
